sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client (Browser/Mobile)
    participant AuthServer as Auth Service
    participant APIServer as API Gateway / Microservices

    Client->>AuthServer: POST /auth/login (username, password)
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Verify Credentials & Sign JWT with Secret/Private Key
    AuthServer-->>Client: 200 OK (access_token: eyJhbGci..., refresh_token: def456...)
    Note over Client: Stores JWT in Memory / HttpOnly Cookie

    Client->>APIServer: GET /api/v1/orders (Header: Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGci...)
    Note over APIServer: Statelessly verifies signature with Public Key / Secret & Checks Expiration
    APIServer->>APIServer: Extracts claims: { sub: "user_42", role: "admin" }
    APIServer-->>Client: 200 OK (Orders Data)
